<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants Swiss banks basket.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants Swiss banks basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Bank AG said it has issued four million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a basket of Swiss banks shares.</p>
<p>The basket is comprised of eight registered shares (32 pct) of CS Holding, four bearer shares (34 pct) of UBS and one registered share (34 pct) of Swiss Bank Corp.</p>
<p>There are 50 warrants per basket.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  5,023 CHF</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p>		STRIKE	PRICE	PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p>TRANCHE 1   5023 CHF    12.31 CHF  12.25 PCT  8.16 X</p>
<p>TRANCHE 2   5525.3 CHF  8.44 CHF   18.40 PCT  11.90 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
